{"ordinal":11000,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454137126913","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Death_0873cde","source":"Alt: Страшно.","target":"Alt: Mi-e frică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11001,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454137126912","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Death_00ec8ce","source":"Alt: Ушла из ёбаного цирка, чтобы клоуны догнали тут.","target":"Alt: Am fugit din circul ăla de căcat, iar clovnii m-au ajuns din urmă aici.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11002,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932619","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Ears_DontShoot_0130835","source":"Alt: Какое странное время сейчас, господи…","target":"Alt: Ce vremuri ciudate trăim, Doamne…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11003,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932618","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Photo_DontShoot_00a569c","source":"Alt: Жаль, некому обо мне погоревать. Никто не сделает тату после моей смерти.","target":"Alt: Păcat că n-are cine să mă plângă. Nimeni nu-și va face un tatuaj după moartea mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11004,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932617","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Armpit_DontShoot_0577cc9","source":"Alt: Вообще лучше не делать тату в неподходящих местах.","target":"Alt: De fapt, e mai bine să nu-ți faci tatuaje în locuri nepotrivite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11005,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932616","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Eyes_DontShoot_065b5f2","source":"Alt: Чтобы всегда видеть его рядом, когда смотрю в зеркало.","target":"Alt: Ca să-l văd mereu lângă mine când mă uit în oglindă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11006,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932615","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Eyes_DontShoot_0d064bf","source":"Alt: Но залила краску в глаза, когда умер самый близкий мне человек.","target":"Alt: Dar mi-am turnat cerneală în ochi când a murit persoana cea mai apropiată de mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11007,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932614","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Eyes_DontShoot_0ee6f33","source":"Alt: И как ты понимаешь, жизнь у меня не сахар.","target":"Alt: Și, cum îți dai seama, viața mea nu-i tocmai roz.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11008,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932613","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Eyes_DontShoot_0acb376","source":"Alt: Как фото на память.","target":"Alt: Ca o fotografie de amintire.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11009,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932612","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Eyes_DontShoot_09f2f55","source":"Alt: Я делала тату в моменты, когда у меня кто-то из друзей или близких умирал.","target":"Alt: Îmi făceam tatuaje de fiecare dată când murea un prieten sau cineva apropiat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11010,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932611","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Hands_DontShoot_085a04e","source":"Alt: Кто знает, что произойдёт, как только я туда вернусь.","target":"Alt: Cine știe ce se întâmplă imediat ce mă întorc acolo.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11011,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932610","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Hands_DontShoot_079b126","source":"Alt: Ради ногтей я в город не вернусь. Не-а.","target":"Alt: Nu mă întorc în oraș doar pentru unghii. Nici vorbă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11012,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932609","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Teeth_DontShoot_067fc96","source":"Alt: Немного нервно, когда тебя угрожают убить.","target":"Alt: E puțin tulburător când cineva te amenință că te omoară.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11013,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454132932608","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Teeth_DontShoot_0102103","source":"Alt: Знаешь, я отдохну недолго от приключений, ладно?","target":"Alt: Știi, aș vrea să iau o scurtă pauză de la aventuri, bine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11014,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454128738316","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Ears_Gun_072e918","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
