{"ordinal":11017,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454128738313","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Alt_Ears_Gun_0a3b07b","source":"Alt: А вот теперь я жалею, что сняла их.","target":"Alt: Acum chiar regret că mi le-am scos.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-281.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
